    "description": "Try out new cat dog music voice piano game with many hit and unique songs you cannot find in any other piano games. Tap the tile to start bork remixes popular songs.\r\n\r\n<b>FEATURES:</b>\r\n- Easy to play, beautiful graphics.\r\n- Great selection of music and songs.\r\n- Hot songs updated every month.\r\n- Vocal from many dogs voice.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Game\u2019s rule:</b>\r\n\r\nIn order to play this piano game, you just have to tap the black tiles and avoid the white tiles. That\u2019s it!!\r\n\r\nSo, get ready and try out magic piano for FREE! This attractive piano game is more challenging than you could imagine.",
